ocumentation\r\n\r\n[Shapecast3D.collision_result](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/3.6/classes/class_shapecast.html#class-shapecast-property-collision-result) claims it returns data the same as `PhysicsDirectSpaceState3D.get_rest_info()`\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nChecking Godot's Core I can see it returns an **additional** collider field: \r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d7cc121e6469d0d998bf214e3a87e37961e6f1bb/scene/3d/physics/shape_cast_3d.cpp#L477-L495\r\n\r\nThis is the same for Shapecast2d: \r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/d7cc121e6469d0d998bf214e3a87e37961e6f1bb/scene/2d/physics/shape_cast_2d.cpp#L384-L402\r\n\r\n## What This PR Adds\r\n\r\nThis PR appends to the documentation string to mention this additional field for both ShapeCast2D and ShapeCast3D.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-07-10T20:30:42Z","updated_at":"2025-10-19T10:52:03Z","closed_at":"2025-10-19T10:48:09Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e1e61a2a4af1661e16752c1b0fb1868c8ce584d0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandS